    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d9108 SNOMED CT 870688007 = ICF d910 Community life, other specified (an
        unspecified-residual entry under the d910 Community/social/civic-life activities block). Target.
        Best available standard target: SNOMED CT's ICF-aligned participation concepts are the only
        concepts that map the d9 community/social-life block. Broader: the SNOMED CT ability concept covers
        the functional dimension of the d910 activity domain. Low tier : source is an residual with no
        specific SNOMED CT equivalent, so the link is loose.
        """
}
