    comment "en" """
        Source d9109 SNOMED CT 870688007 = ICF d910 Community life, unspecified. Target = Ability to
        participate in community social life, the ICF-aligned functioning concept for the d910 domain.
        Best available standard target. Broader: ability concept covers the functional dimension of the
        activity domain. Low tier : unspecified source mapped to the general participation concept, no
