mapping "e1100.1" source="e1100" target="SNOMED_CT:762766007" relationship=related_to effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1100 SNOMED CT 762766007 = ICF e1100 Food (food as an environmental-factor product for
        personal consumption). Target. Related (not equivalent): SNOMED CT models food as a substance
        (clinical/chemistry framing), whereas ICF e1100 models food as an environmental
        facilitator/barrier (social-framework framing) — the two share the referent but differ in
        ontological role. Weak tier : a loose aspect-level link recorded to preserve the lead; the
        target is the underlying substance, not the environmental-factor concept.
        """
}
