        product for personal consumption). Target. Related (not equivalent): SNOMED CT models medicines as
        clinical products/substances, whereas ICF e1101 models them as environmental
        facilitators/barriers — the two share the referent but differ in ontological role. Weak tier : a
        loose aspect-level link; the target is the underlying product, not the environmental-factor
        concept.
        """
}
