mapping "e1358.1" source="e1358" target="SNOMED_CT:705347008" relationship=source_is_broader_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1358 SNOMED CT 705347008 = ICF e135 residual (any product/technology used in employment,
        both general and assistive). Target (Athena 45767788), active, standard. Why this target: only
        SNOMED CT concept in the employment-device space. Why narrower/ : SNOMED CT target covers only the
        ASSISTIVE-device slice of e135, which also subsumes general (non-assistive) employment
        technology; target is more specific than the source's full scope, so the map silently drops the
        general-product axis. Residual code adds further ambiguity about which specific product is
        meant.
        """
}
mapping "e1359.1" source="e1359" target="SNOMED_CT:705347008" relationship=source_is_broader_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1359 SNOMED CT 705347008 = ICF e135 residual. Target (Athena 45767788) =, active, standard.
        Why this target: only SNOMED CT concept in the employment-device space. Why narrower/ : SNOMED CT
        target is the assistive-device subset only, while the ICF source spans all employment products
        and technology; forced down to the assistive slice because no general employment-product concept
        exists. Unspecified source compounds the fit loss.
        """
}
mapping "e140.1" source="e140" target="SNOMED_CT:70793005" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e140 SNOMED CT 705386007 70793005 = ICF chapter-level (general + assistive products).
        Targets: SNOMED CT 70793005 (Athena 4321852), active, standard; SNOMED CT 705386007 (Athena 45767812)
        =, active, standard. Why partial: is broader than either target — 70793005 captures the
        general-equipment slice, 705386007 the assistive-device slice; neither subsumes culture/sport
        products in full and there is no single encompassing SNOMED CT concept. 70793005 listed first as it
        covers more of the source (general recreation/culture/sport equipment). per partial multi-target
        guidance.
        """
}
mapping "e140.2" source="e140" target="SNOMED_CT:705386007" relationship=partial_overlap {
