}
mapping "e1400.1" source="e1400" target="SNOMED_CT:70793005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1400 SNOMED CT 70793005 = ICF e140 (the non-assistive, general-product sub-code). Target
        (Athena 4321852), active, standard. Why this target: closest standard concept to general
        recreation/culture/sport products; (49062001). Why broader/ : target legitimately subsumes the
        source's general-product meaning (every general recreation product is recreation equipment),
        though SNOMED CT's term says and omits explicit culture/sport breadth — a small semantic stretch,
        hence moderate not high tier.
        """
}
mapping "e1401.1" source="e1401" target="SNOMED_CT:705386007" relationship=equivalent quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1401 SNOMED CT 705386007 = ICF e140. Target (Athena 45767812) (1141802005). Why
        exact_match/ : source's and target denote the same clinical concept (assistive devices for
        recreation); strong term and hierarchy alignment. High rather than because the ICF source
        explicitly spans culture+recreation+sport while the SNOMED CT term names only, a minor breadth
        nuance not independently crosswalk-verified.
        """
}
mapping "e1408.1" source="e1408" target="SNOMED_CT:70793005" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1408 SNOMED CT 70793005 = ICF e140 residual. Target (Athena 4321852) =, active, standard.
        Why partial/ : residual source is heterogeneous and the single target captures only the
        general-equipment slice of the broader products-and-technology domain; weak lead, not an
        asserted identity. (705386007) not added as a second target because the framing gives no basis
        to weight the assistive slice. Documented as a reviewer lead.
        """
}
mapping "e1409.1" source="e1409" target="SNOMED_CT:70793005" relationship=partial_overlap effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source e1409 SNOMED CT 70793005 = ICF e140 residual. Target (Athena 4321852) =, active, standard.
